Date: 2024-10-08
Encoding: UTF-8
Description: Implements an extension of the general modeling framework
    in the 'SoftBart' package for models combining linear covariate
    effects with a nonparametric tree-based mean function. The package
    adds explicit handling of grouped predictors through hierarchical
    prior updates and provides functionality for both regression and
    binary outcome models.
